      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 600–800 K, defect mobility and dynamic phase transformations are active without excessive thermal diffusion.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn addition increases the configurational entropy of the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn addition regulates defect mobilities in the irradiated matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Equal point-defect mobilities are associated with the exceptional radiation tolerance of the baseline W-based alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6397024::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased configurational entropy destabilizes segregation of Cr and V into precipitates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn-mediated dynamic precipitate control delays or suppresses irradiation-induced Cr–V-rich particle nucleation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 8 dpa and 600–800 K, the Mn-modified alloy will have a significantly lower Cr–V-rich precipitate volume fraction than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mn-modified alloy will retain hardness similar to, or marginally better than, the baseline after irradiation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing Cr–V precipitation through Mn addition will preserve the alloy's radiation resistance and low irradiation hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn addition at the proposed level will not compromise practical bulk manufacturability.",
